       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed it (Order ID: ORD-0001): sertraline 600 mg by mouth, once daily.\n\nThe order note says the dose is above the 200 mg/day maximum and that you confirmed it was intended. It also asks for pharmacy verification and monitoring for serotonin syndrome, QT prolongation, and seizures.\n\nYou may want to consider a baseline ECG and electrolytes, and a review of the patient's other serotonergic or QT-prolonging medications. Pharmacy may call you to verify the dose."
